Data License Notice:

The datasets included in this repository are derived from the following
public sources and are subject to their respective licenses:

- Settlement data (EKATTE): National Statistical Institute of Bulgaria (NSI)
  -- public government data
- Population data: General Directorate "Civil Registration and Administrative
  Services" (GRAO) -- public government data
- Bus stop locations: Data provided by municipalities through the information
  system of the State Agency for Road Safety (DA BDP) -- public government data
- Administrative boundaries: geoBoundaries (www.geoboundaries.org)
  -- Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International (CC-BY-4.0)
- Base map tiles: OpenStreetMap contributors
  -- Open Data Commons Open Database License (ODbL)
